# Print with Zwe — Cursor Rules

## Project Overview
- **Brand:** Print with Zwe — 3D Printing Service & Custom Fabrication
- **Stack:** React (Vite), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Shadcn-style UI, Lucide React, Framer Motion
- **Theme:** Modern precision tech, dark mode preferred, subtle mesh grids, clean cards

## Architecture
- Functional components only with strict TypeScript (no `any`)
- Components live in `src/components/` (`ui/`, `layout/`, `sections/`)
- Types in `src/types/`, utilities in `src/lib/`
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes
- Use `lucide-react` for icons

## Coding Standards
- Responsive Tailwind utilities (`sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`)
- Client-side form validation before submission
- Handle loading and empty states for async work
- Production-ready code — avoid placeholder comments

## Feature Roadmap
1. Hero with quote CTA modal
2. Services showcase
3. Interactive print gallery
4. Price estimator
5. Contact / order inquiry form
